def blog_para(title,subject,evidence,exception,heading,marker,variant):
 if variant==1:return f'{title} begins with one bounded {subject} population, a declared entity and period, the preparing role, and the authorized finance owner. During {heading.lower()}, retain {evidence} as separate artifacts rather than turning a queue label into the conclusion. Trace {marker}-A identifies the source version, actor, timestamp, currency or amount where relevant, current state, and safe stopping condition. Outsourced AP may retrieve, label, compare, calculate, and follow up inside written permissions, but it does not approve accounting, tax, legal, vendor-master, banking, access, or payment outcomes. Changed scope opens a new version so correction never erases the instruction that governed earlier work.'
 return f'For {subject}, {marker}-B reconciles population membership before totals and records included, excluded, missing, duplicated, rejected, unresolved, and accepted items. The ordinary fixture contains consistent sources, an authorized decision, and a destination receipt. The adverse fixture introduces the condition where {exception}. Preserve both versions, name the disputed field, route one answerable question to its owner, assign a due point, and hold the dependent action. Use synthetic supplier, invoice, bank, tax, employee, and credential data in rehearsal. Closure for {title} requires the approved instruction to agree with observed system or bank evidence, an independent reviewer to reproduce the comparison, every exception to retain a disposition, and an accountable owner to record acceptance.'

