def research_body(title,subject,question,heading,marker):
 return (f'{heading}: {title} asks {question}. The eligible population is a declared set of synthetic {subject} events from one entity and observation period, and the unit is one event linked to source, version, actor, timestamp, owner, exception, and destination receipt. {marker}-A freezes inclusion, exclusion, missingness, and refresh rules before results are inspected. Reviewers classify evidence as confirmed, inferred, conflicting, unavailable, or awaiting decision. A dashboard state, successful upload, closed ticket, matching total, or automated acknowledgment is evidence of one event; none alone proves accounting treatment, supplier identity, bank acceptance, tax result, or payment authority. '
         f'{marker}-B samples consecutive ordinary records plus boundary, corrected, rejected, reopened, unavailable-system, and high-consequence cases. Synthetic identifiers replace live supplier, invoice, employee, bank, tax, access, and credential data. Reconcile population membership before amounts and preserve unmatched items in both directions. Report numerator, denominator, cohort, period, exclusions, missing values, unresolved count, median elapsed time, and tail cases. A second reviewer independently repeats the highest-consequence comparison under the frozen field dictionary and records disagreements before reconciliation. '
         f'Interpretation for {subject} tests alternatives such as source latency, document quality, system batching, time-zone conversion, rule-version drift, population mix, and owner availability before suggesting cause. Public sources support control and evidence concepts in their own domains; they do not certify a provider, establish the outcome for a private transaction, or set a universal threshold. Outsourced AP can assemble and compare the evidence while qualified finance, treasury, tax, legal, vendor, privacy, security, and payment owners retain consequential decisions. Reproduce the selection rule, source index, calculations, reviewer notes, exception dispositions, limitations, implementation evidence, and owner acceptance before using the finding in another period.')

